{
  "key": "letter-049-part-01",
  "number": 49,
  "generationId": "01a1e4f1-207d-751a-9d1d-50f81e083ea6",
  "voice": "Views",
  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Love.",
      "path": "audio/1968-49/01.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.641837
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "I am so happy to have got your letter.",
      "path": "audio/1968-49/02.mp3",
      "start": 1.908322,
      "end": 4.112268
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Can even a ray of love ever come without the fragrance of joy?",
      "path": "audio/1968-49/03.mp3",
      "start": 5.50746,
      "end": 8.986711999999999
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "And what is joy but the fragrance of love?",
      "path": "audio/1968-49/04.mp3",
      "start": 10.590771,
      "end": 13.03229
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Yet the world is full of mad people seeking happiness their whole lives - but with their backs turned towards love!",
      "path": "audio/1968-49/05.mp3",
      "start": 14.383152,
      "end": 20.972336000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "The doors to God only open when love turns into the prayer of our total being.",
      "path": "audio/1968-49/06.mp3",
      "start": 22.258208999999997,
      "end": 26.947438000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "But perhaps his doors are already open, yet eyes closed to love will, even so, never be able to see them.",
      "path": "audio/1968-49/07.mp3",
      "start": 28.266327,
      "end": 33.844443999999996
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "And what is this you write? momentary contact?",
      "path": "audio/1968-49/08.mp3",
      "start": 35.145918,
      "end": 37.893491999999995
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "No!",
      "path": "audio/1968-49/09.mp3",
      "start": 39.365147,
      "end": 39.918662
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "No!",
      "path": "audio/1968-49/10.mp3",
      "start": 41.498503,
      "end": 42.29
    }
  ]
}
